  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, the dreamguard can enter into their guardian of the realm state at will (without a rounds per day limit). In addition, any enemy creature who ends their turn within 10 feet of the dreamguard must make a Will save (DC 10 + 1/2 level + Charisma modifier) or fall asleep (ala the slumber class feature).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dreamguard#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
